    "GACHON UNIVERSITY - Online Systems & Apps\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nAdmin System(학사행정시스템)\nYou can check your timetable, registered courses and grades.\n※ ID & Password will be provided before the semester start.\nCOURSEMOS(CYBER CAMPUS)\nYou can check class announcements and assignments.\nElectronic Attendance(전자출결시스템\n)\nIn large classes, attendance can be checked using the electronic attendance system.\nMobile Library(가천대학교 모바일 도서관)\nYou can check your mobile student ID(QR CODE), which can be used to access campus facilities and borrow books.\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nReport abuse"
